{"about_the_game":"Experience a day in the life of a college student Dylan on his last exam in this beautifully hand-drawn watercolor adventure puzzle game. We will witness the day that shapes his future.<br><br>Explore the streets, interact with quirky characters, and solve puzzles to help Dylan overcome his goals. With a unique blend of story and gameplay, The Last Exam will keep you engaged and entertained from start to finish.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a vibrant, hand-crafted city and its hidden corners<br></li><li>Solve puzzles using logic, observation, and intuition<br></li><li>Discover Dylan's backstory and relationships through his interactions and memories<br></li><li>Experience a bittersweet tale of personal growth and self-discovery</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2329900?t=1745940751","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745940751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329900/2b621a91131af70cfbb442fb2d06e9841c148a7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745940751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329900/2b621a91131af70cfbb442fb2d06e9841c148a7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745940751","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3168080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"Experience a day in the life of a college student Dylan on his last exam in this beautifully hand-drawn watercolor adventure puzzle game. We will witness the day that shapes his future.<br><br>Explore the streets, interact with quirky characters, and solve puzzles to help Dylan overcome his goals. With a unique blend of story and gameplay, The Last Exam will keep you engaged and entertained from start to finish.<h2 class=